\n\nNow, to get the curve $x=-{y}^{2}-\\frac{8y}{5},$ we just have to reflect the curve $y=-{x}^{2}-\\frac{8x}{5}$ over the line $y=x,$ as follows:\n\n![](images/04/049683350600f401aa18feb6d5ea5662965ba0740f4b23a524e93e40f61f0bc4.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186558537 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157354 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1f2981f6-bfbf-5c1e-a4a2-2814dc24804a" :knowledge-point/title "Plotting a Quadratic Function Where X Is a Function of Y"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31ed5b57-7d3a-53aa-bf54-d8eb0cf2cb49" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5c/5c627d1c7c8fab8b73e97a975d37b56be387339adfcef7073807963c19b26f2d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557970} {:answer/id #uuid "58b1983c-18f3-5542-9076-1c78882e1f8f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/66/668786e30fc7ece2a3f873e86834550855e07fc0fbf418c224dc669e7ab23c18.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558034} {:answer/id #uuid "9ff3976b-79cd-5180-bdcb-9121641cbc7e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/a0/a065759d37f8f6f96c83959b91eb3a758e74823ad9adaa47ace40bc03e7257cd.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558182} {:answer/id #uuid "ca03cca9-183a-5dc9-9a67-05b176a0db7e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e9/e96b63cb44319651e4347943f6545028016be0091c33c57300f3fae17aebe6e3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558270} {:answer/id #uuid "d0713804-9119-5d0d-8f0f-eeb95e3b9ab5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/04/049189d09eef52abfeff3c442efa16753e98752c5f34102170befe4018994036.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186558280}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "31ed5b57-7d3a-53aa-bf54-d8eb0cf2cb49" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "image