 of $x=f(y).$" :question/worked-solution "To plot the graph of $x=f(y),$ we take the graph of $y=f(x)$ and reflect it over the line $y=x,$ as follows:\n\n![](images/3d/3de22190f1403db6f951eba0fbf8acfafa0918f68dfa7bae38b184cc86143f6d.png)"}]}
